@startuml
title UML state machine diagram

[*] --> InitialState
InitialState : Display home page
InitialState --> ServiceCenterHome : Logged in
ServiceCenterHome : Display journey details upon user login and destination selection
ServiceCenterHome --> JourneyDetails : Destination selected
JourneyDetails : Allow users to activate driving mode or choose other options after viewing journey details
JourneyDetails --> DrivingModeActivated : Driving mode activated
JourneyDetails --> OtherOptions : Other options chosen
OtherOptions : Enable users to select a place to eat, view its menu, and place an order if they are hungry
OtherOptions --> FoodSelection : Place to eat selected
FoodSelection : View menu
FoodSelection --> MenuViewed : Menu viewed
MenuViewed : Place order if user is hungry
MenuViewed --> OrderPlaced : Order placed
OrderPlaced : Inform relevant authorities in the event of an accident
OrderPlaced --> Accident : Accident occurred
Accident : Send notifications during driving or in case of an accident
Accident --> NotificationSent : Notification sent
NotificationSent : Allow users to provide feedback upon completion of their journey
NotificationSent --> Feedback : Feedback provided
Feedback : Return to initial state
ServiceCenterHome : Expiry Notification page
ServiceCenterHome --> ExpiryNotification : Expiry notification received
ExpiryNotification : Send service request to Car owner
ExpiryNotification --> ServiceRequestSent : Service request sent
ExpiryNotification : Return to Service center home page
ServiceCenterHome : Enter Damaged parts list
ServiceCenterHome --> EnteringDamagedPartsList : Enter damaged parts list required
EnteringDamagedPartsList : Preparing and entering damaged parts list
EnteringDamagedPartsList --> DamagedPartsListEntered : Damaged parts list entered
EnteringDamagedPartsList : Return to service center home page
ServiceCenterHome : Updating Information list
ServiceCenterHome --> UpdatingInformation : Changed parts information available for updating
UpdatingInformation : Update Information
UpdatingInformation --> InformationUpdated : Information updated
UpdatingInformation : Return to Service center home page
Logout : To Logout
Logout --> LoggedOut : Logout completed
Logout : Logged out Successfully
@enduml
